# CareCircle AI — Complete Conversation Intelligence & Persistent Memory Overhaul

The CareCircle AI chat currently feels repetitive and does not properly maintain conversational context.

I want you to fix the underlying AI architecture, not simply change the wording of responses.

I also want to add a proper **persistent user memory system** so the AI can remember useful information across different conversations.

## IMPORTANT: Before changing anything

First inspect the entire existing AI architecture and Supabase database/migrations.

Audit:

* AI model/provider
* AI API route
* System prompt
* Conversation history
* Message storage
* Conversation IDs
* User context
* AI response generation
* Streaming
* Fallback responses
* Error handling
* Token/history limits
* Supabase schema
* Existing migrations
* Existing RLS policies
* Existing user/subscription tables
* Existing conversation tables

Do not assume anything about the current architecture.

Do not break existing functionality.

